# 📦 Day 01 — Data Modeling (Star Schema)

## 🎯 Objective

Design a simple Data Warehouse using Star Schema for analytical queries.

## 🧠 Concepts Covered

* Data Modeling
* OLTP vs OLAP
* Star Schema
* Snowflake Schema

## 🏗️ Architecture

* Fact Table: sales
* Dimensions:

  * product
  * customer
  * date

## ⚙️ Why Star Schema?

I chose Star Schema because:

* Simpler queries
* Better performance for analytics

## ⚖️ Trade-offs

| Pros               | Cons            |
| ------------------ | --------------- |
| Fast queries       | Data redundancy |
| Easy to understand | Less normalized |

## 📊 Example Query

```sql
SELECT p.category, SUM(f.revenue)
FROM sales_fact f
JOIN product_dim p ON f.product_id = p.product_id
GROUP BY p.category;
```

## 💡 Key Learning

Understanding how data modeling impacts performance and analytics.

